sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant G as Drone + gateway
    participant L as Listener / ingest API
    participant J as background_jobs (PostgreSQL)
    participant W as Worker
    participant T as telemetry_service
    participant H as HUMS
    participant M as M7
    G->>L: MAVLink frames (signed) / HTTP batch
    L->>J: enqueue acquisition.ingest (idempotency key)
    W->>J: claim (FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED)
    W->>T: process_normalized_event (SAVEPOINT per event)
    T->>T: dedupe · quality gate · asset/tenant map (unknown → QUARANTINED)
    T->>H: readings
    H->>H: features · baseline · limits → exceedance (advisory lock)
    H-->>M: finding + evidence; signal synced on next M7 sync
    alt handler error
        W->>J: retry with backoff → DEAD after max attempts
    end
